# AICL Example: Chat Application
# A multiplayer chat application

Goal:
Create a multiplayer chat application

Constraint:
Must support at least 100 concurrent users

Constraint:
Maximum memory usage 512 MB

Constraint:
Messages must be delivered in order

Risk:
Server becomes unavailable

Recovery:
Reconnect automatically with exponential backoff

Risk:
Network latency exceeds threshold

Recovery:
Enable offline mode with message queue

Risk:
User disconnects unexpectedly

Recovery:
Retry connection three times then show status

Risk:
Message delivery failure

Recovery:
Store locally and retry on reconnect

Layer:
User Interface
    Sublayer:
    Message display
    Sublayer:
    Input field
    Sublayer:
    User list
    Sublayer:
    Status indicators

Layer:
Networking
    Sublayer:
    WebSocket client
    Sublayer:
    Message serialization
    Sublayer:
    Heartbeat system

Layer:
Chat Logic
    Sublayer:
    Message routing
    Sublayer:
    User management
    Sublayer:
    Channel management

Layer:
Persistence
    Sublayer:
    Message history
    Sublayer:
    User preferences
    Sublayer:
    Offline queue

Entity User
    name: string
    id: integer
    status: string
    avatar_url: string

Entity Message
    content: string
    timestamp: datetime
    sender: User

Entity Channel
    name: string
    id: integer
    members: list

Behavior SendMessage

Input:
    User Message

Output:
    DeliveredMessage

Action:
    transmit message to server and broadcast to channel

Behavior JoinChannel

Input:
    User Channel

Action:
    add user to channel and notify members

Condition:

When server unavailable

Then enable offline mode

Condition:

When network restored

Then sync offline messages

Event:

On message received

Action:
    display message in channel

Event:

On user join

Action:
    update user list

Event:

On user leave

Action:
    remove from user list and notify

Parallel:

User Interface
Networking

Optimize:
Memory usage

Optimize:
Network latency

Security:

Encrypt:
    message content

Protect:
    user credentials

Learn:

User behavior

Goal:
    improve message suggestions

Validation:
Send and receive messages successfully

Validation:
Average latency below 100 ms

Validation:
No data loss after reconnect

Validation:
100 concurrent users can chat without errors
